 class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Feature</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends or play with other players using the server browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use our in-game text chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958230/extras/9efb49e7155ff5ce14019bad1f6a5f82.poster.avif?t=1727159741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958230/extras/9efb49e7155ff5ce14019bad1f6a5f82.webm?t=1727159741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958230/extras/9efb49e7155ff5ce14019bad1f6a5f82.mp4?t=1727159741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains flashing lights and effects that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. The player is advised to be careful.</p>",
